{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：19:38 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"「魅力知福」神仙谷中首捷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/f6e58ccf23c0ece0050732ef9a92669e/2026-11/r2_2.jpg\"/>\n<p>上周日連中三元，包括與練馬師蔡約翰攜手起孖的的騎師艾兆禮，今晚騎練又再合作岀擊得手，在第二場以「魅力知福」贏馬，此駒十日前在此程跑二，今晚再岀即贏馬補中。此場頭馬亦是蔡約翰今季第一場谷中勝仗。</p>\n<p>賽後「魅力知福」馬主鄧子豐說:「『魅力知福』上場跑得第二名，走勢已經接近，因此今場有信心，馬兒今季有進步，比上季更為成熟，希望牠越跑越進步。」</p>\n<p>鄧子豐的姐姐鄧詠琪說:「『魅力知福』今仗排十檔，我都有點擔心，幸好今晚有得追，今場形勢啱馬兒跑。此馬比較遲熟，來香港早期不太適應環境，需要一點時間，我們十分感謝蔡約翰和馬房員工對此馬的照顧，很開心牠除了沙田外，快活谷都能跑得好成績希望，我們希望此馬升上四班後仍然繼續有進步表現。」</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8adb62e34e738dfa649ef643ea845357/2026-11/0e2543b8-6969-48e0-8872-ed3cffab476b.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/35ca7c8c15884ca3d2358d7be3d965f0/2026-11/5b57ef86-2b2d-46a3-a63a-671edf831f45.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/15b2db603abf6acb8cecb83df6e11e98/2026-11/6bed3ce4-cec8-4f9c-b81b-f2497729fd19.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/770e10e6698b69e2dfc11fdad926434d/2026-11/9ff909bd-a0e1-4e03-9566-fca480c2b830.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a35de96124a9a2a6999c4e02b007b5e4/2026-11/51ef0b20-096d-4040-a1bd-f4878f8d275f.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/99dd48e82d5686d9f9ef2d12381a1cf3/2026-11/59b0b149-800d-486b-9cb0-88d22c82c89a.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/494cf78d13476173b9e194dfe85b46ff/2026-11/61b4109a-79d7-4419-b1c2-536fa487defc.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2d2371b4eca6f48545fb97db160f8e98/2026-11/390fb86e-35bb-4220-8414-6f6b21d8dec5.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d541b45dde370b0732f2bab9ddc187c8/2026-11/89049c89-c383-4868-97fe-5ddf9d4083a1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a7f372ead15ec995c5435caf7f01d1dd/2026-11/9601105b-948e-4e80-83ea-63977074c195.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7143c8a1144f9933f5fae333e056eb66/2026-11/34019114-c6ba-40a9-afd6-0ef4e563ee5d.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1b67fac6d32e05b96a08f2ff1b57524f/2026-11/e1b85e2b-a26a-4a88-8053-131e787e7f4e.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/06aa52315c1c9ac2ce77c39302f16a08/2026-11/e438eb76-ec21-4090-b41d-1ba0b6aee6e7.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/82cfdc34c20de778efa412eebd79669c/2026-11/fd9e42e5-19d4-4f1e-89a4-3d9084151b98.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T12:38:06.003745+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":345,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T11:38:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:46.501504+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T12:31:37.487982+00:00","content_hash":"862a297b61071370254b3a9e3b2e9b8d1c6f24fa5a038ced268309327afc82a6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}